{"ID":"20240513083458-jh81yzu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083458-jh81yzu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083458-jh81yzu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513094847-ugwfyye\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513094847-ugwfyye\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513094847-ugwfyye\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:724,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:724\u0026#125;","title":"005","type":"doc","updated":"20240514084444"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513094847-ugwfyye","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1031px;","id":"20240513094847-ugwfyye","updated":"20240514084444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/4/8"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"252-2 Y, J"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 65, 中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/04/15"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目乾口乾.咽喉乾燥, 吞嚥困難. 皮膚緊乾, 右手肘骨大片積鈣. 杵狀趾. 仍有胃酸反流及靜脈瘤．"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：服前方後\n1、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": 睡眠好轉"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、 大便:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大便好許多, 一天二次. 顏色深褐 (有內出血)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、 小便:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 正常, 顏色淡黃."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、 手足溫度:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 雙手足仍冷. (陽虛)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、 流汗:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 偶而流汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、 口渴:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 有改善, 喜嚼冰塊, 但冰品又令胃不適. (上熱下寒) "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、 胃口:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 常感飢餓, 因為更改飲食習慣, 一時找不到適當的食物."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、 精神體力"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": 還是容易疲倦 (有內出血也容易疲倦, 腎陽虛)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、 其他體症:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本週有二三次噁心反胃. 胃酸仍有。眼睛四周有壓力, 眼睛容易倦怠."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈小無力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其他："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乾皺如橘皮, 舌體小. (心臟功能差)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 瞳孔無腎臟反應. 無白內障. 肝區尚好."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心陽受損, 肝家積毒, 腎陽不足, 脾濕不足, 胃內仍有出血"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 消除眼框四周的壓力"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合谷, 養老, 睛明, 太陽, 頭臨泣"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：同4/8方 加 阿膠3錢 灶心土5錢  吳茱萸2錢  亁薑2錢\n今日方如下 ："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"旋覆花三錢  代赭石三錢  吳茱萸二錢  乾薑二錢 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"降胃酸反逆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生薑二錢  大棗十枚  炙甘草三錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子五錢  半夏三錢  栀子三錢  ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"利膈湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石膏三兩  知母五錢  ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"滅胃火, 去癮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝五錢  細辛二錢 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手足冷, 當歸四逆湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白芍一兩 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"靜脈瘤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木通三錢 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"通便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") 當歸三錢 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"補血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阿膠三錢 (烊化, 分三包)  灶心土五錢(棉布包) ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黃土湯止血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")       "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗→3碗, "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前喝, 熱藥冷服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT- 48 30 x 2 午餐與臨睡前"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"1、 睡前飲50%蔗糖水後, 小腿已無抽筋."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2、 血無止法. 此患者為虛症, 裡面沒有陰實. 故可使用黃土湯止血."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"3、 水生木; 患者腎不足, 水不涵木, 造成眼部的不適. 察其眼睛, 並無結構性問題, 眼框四周略腫. 此乃水不生木, 腎的冷水積聚所致."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}